WEBVTT

00:09.067 --> 00:10.700
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.767 --> 00:12.167
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.233 --> 00:14.133
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.200 --> 00:17.167
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:17.233 --> 00:19.267
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.333 --> 00:21.267
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.333 --> 00:23.167
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.233 --> 00:24.900
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.967 --> 00:27.300
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.367 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.433 --> 00:31.233
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.300 --> 00:33.267
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:33.333 --> 00:35.133
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.200 --> 00:37.267
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.333 --> 00:39.400
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.467 --> 00:40.733
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.800 --> 00:42.600
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:45.400 --> 00:47.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:53.767 --> 01:01.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:02.100 --> 01:04.067
- Ah, I don't know
what I love more, Squidward,
- 啊，我不知道
我更喜欢什么，章鱼哥，

01:04.100 --> 01:06.100
feeding people Krabby Patties
during the day,
给人们喂蟹肉饼
白天，

01:06.167 --> 01:07.500
or cleaning up
their mess at night.
或清理
他们晚上的混乱。

01:07.567 --> 01:08.800
Are you kidding me?
你在开玩笑吧？

01:08.867 --> 01:10.067
Look at all this garbage
看看这些垃圾

01:10.133 --> 01:11.867
those animals left behind.
那些留下来的动物。

01:11.933 --> 01:14.200
Hm.
- One man's garbage...
嗯。
- 一个人的垃圾...

01:17.400 --> 01:19.667
So much gum!
这么多口香糖！

01:19.733 --> 01:21.067
Ooh, this is gonna be fun.
哦，这会很有趣。

01:21.100 --> 01:23.067
Ooh-wah!
- Ow!
哦，哇！
- 噢！

01:23.067 --> 01:25.200
Hey, watch it--
嘿，注意看——

01:29.267 --> 01:31.900
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:35.067 --> 01:37.800
Ah! Urchin!
啊!顽童！

01:37.867 --> 01:39.867
- That's no urchin,
it's a Krabby Patty.
- 这不是顽童，
这是蟹肉饼。

01:39.933 --> 01:43.867
- Yuck. A rotten Krabby Patty.
- 恶心。腐烂的蟹肉饼。

01:43.933 --> 01:45.500
- Wait, Squidward!
- 等等，章鱼哥！

01:45.567 --> 01:47.333
You can't throw out
a Krabby Patty.
你不能扔掉
蟹肉饼。

01:47.400 --> 01:50.400
That is just wrong.
- But this one is rotten.
那是错误的。
- 但是这个已经烂了。

01:50.467 --> 01:52.067
- Oh, simple Squidward...
- 哦，简单的章鱼哥……

01:52.133 --> 01:54.767
- No Krabby Patty
can ever truly be rotten.
- 没有蟹肉饼
可能真的会腐烂。

01:54.833 --> 01:56.667
Here, look...
在这里，看...

01:56.733 --> 01:58.367
- Ah!
- 啊！

01:58.433 --> 01:59.900
- Mmm...
- 嗯...

02:07.533 --> 02:09.500
- Oh, that looks delicious.
- 哦，看起来很好吃。

02:09.567 --> 02:11.733
Why don't you take
another bite?
你为什么不采取
再咬一口？

02:11.800 --> 02:13.433
- No thanks.
- 不，谢谢。

02:13.500 --> 02:16.700
Uh, it's so delicious, I think
I'll save the rest for later.
嗯，我觉得很好吃
剩下的我会留着以后用。

02:22.467 --> 02:24.933
No, Patty,
you stay where you are.
不，帕蒂，
你留在原地。

02:26.700 --> 02:28.867
- Are you doing all right
there, friend?
- 你还好吗
在那里，朋友？

02:28.933 --> 02:30.500
- Oh, I--I'm all right.
- 哦，我 - 我没事。

02:32.900 --> 02:35.067
Yoo
尤

02:35.067 --> 02:37.967
- Why, I'm your
new best friend.
- 为什么，我是你的
新最好的朋友。

02:38.067 --> 02:41.100
You can call me Cuddle E. Hugs.
你可以叫我 Cuddle E. Hugs。

02:41.167 --> 02:42.567
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:42.633 --> 02:44.600
I like the sound of that.
我喜欢那个声音。

02:44.667 --> 02:47.133
- Then bring it in
for the real deal!
- 然后把它带进来
真正的交易！

02:47.200 --> 02:49.167
Whee!
哎哟！

02:49.233 --> 02:51.600
- That's what I call a hug.
- 这就是我所说的拥抱。

02:51.667 --> 02:54.067
- Of course it is!
- 当然是！

02:54.133 --> 02:56.633
Hugs is my last name,
after all.
拥抱是我的姓氏
毕竟。

02:57.833 --> 02:59.667
- So tender.
- I try.
- 如此温柔。
- 我试试。

02:59.733 --> 03:02.100
But enough of this.
How about you show
但这已经够了。
你展示一下怎么样

03:02.167 --> 03:04.567
your new best friend
around town?
你最好的新朋友
城镇周围？

03:04.633 --> 03:07.800
- You got it, Cuddle E. Hugs.
- 你明白了，拥抱 E. 拥抱。

03:15.267 --> 03:17.900
Wow!
哇！

03:17.967 --> 03:20.167
Wow!
哇！

03:23.233 --> 03:26.167
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:26.233 --> 03:29.467
all:
全部：

03:33.567 --> 03:37.200
What a great night!
多么美好的夜晚啊！

03:40.067 --> 03:41.533
- Oh, hey, Gary.
- 哦，嘿，加里。

03:41.600 --> 03:44.600
Say hello to my new best
friend, Cuddle E. Hugs.
向我的最佳新人问好
朋友，拥抱E。拥抱。

03:44.667 --> 03:48.200
- A pleasure.
- 很高兴。

03:48.267 --> 03:51.533
- Come on, Gary. Bed time.
- Meow!
- 来吧，加里。就寝时间。
- 喵！

03:51.600 --> 03:53.067
- Mm! Ooh!
- Here's my room!
- 毫米！哦！
- 这是我的房间！

03:53.133 --> 03:54.200
You can take the bed,
if you want.
可以把床拿走，
如果你愿意的话。

03:54.267 --> 03:56.833
- Nonsense. We can share it!
- 废话。我们可以分享！

03:56.900 --> 03:58.833
- Ow.
- 噢。

04:00.400 --> 04:02.067
Looks like your friend
Cuddle E. Hugs
看起来像你的朋友
拥抱 E. 拥抱

04:02.100 --> 04:03.767
needs to lay off the snacks.
需要戒掉零食。

04:03.833 --> 04:05.767
But no need to worry,
SpongeBob,
但无需担心，
海绵宝宝，

04:05.833 --> 04:09.067
I got your new bed right here.
- Ha! Ha!
我在这里给你准备了新床。
- 哈！哈!

04:09.133 --> 04:11.067
Whoo-hoo! Hooray!
呼呼！万岁！

04:17.333 --> 04:19.633
You are the absolute best
at snuggles.
你绝对是最好的
依偎着。

04:19.700 --> 04:22.433
- I didn't get the first name
Cuddle for nothing.
- 我不知道名字
无缘无故地抱抱。

04:29.533 --> 04:32.133
How'd you sleep, Cuddle E.?
你睡得怎么样，卡德尔·E？

04:32.200 --> 04:33.600
Oh, good morning, Gary.
哦，早上好，加里。

04:33.667 --> 04:35.233
Hey, have you seen
Cuddle E. Hugs anywhere?
嘿嘿，你见过吗
在任何地方拥抱E.拥抱？

04:37.400 --> 04:38.867
Aw, what if I never
see him again
噢，如果我永远不会怎么办？
再次见到他

04:38.933 --> 04:41.900
or feel his furry embrace?
或者感受他毛茸茸的拥抱？

04:41.967 --> 04:45.367
Maybe a bite of Krabby Patty
will make me feel better.
也许咬一口蟹肉饼
会让我感觉好一些。

04:45.433 --> 04:46.967
- Meow...
- 喵...

04:49.900 --> 04:51.400
I don't feel so good.
我感觉不太好。

04:51.467 --> 04:53.600
I must miss Cuddle
more than I thought.
我一定想念卡德尔
比我想象的还要多。

04:53.667 --> 04:56.433
- And I miss you.
You're still here.
- 我想念你。
你还在这里。

04:56.500 --> 04:58.533
- Of course I am.
- Yee-hee!
- 我当然是。
- 呀嘿！

04:58.600 --> 05:00.933
- Aw. Wow!
- 噢。哇！

05:01.067 --> 05:03.433
That kiss was even more tender
than the first one.
那个吻更加温柔
比第一个。

05:03.500 --> 05:04.900
- I've been practicing.
- 我一直在练习。

05:04.967 --> 05:07.200
It's our ability to give
tender head kisses
这是我们的能力给予
温柔的头吻

05:07.267 --> 05:10.600
that separates us from the
lower life forms, SpongeBob.
使我们与
低等生命形式，海绵宝宝。

05:10.667 --> 05:12.933
Come here.
过来吧。

05:17.867 --> 05:20.600
- So, best friend,
what should we do today?
- 那么，最好的朋友，
今天我们应该做什么？

05:20.667 --> 05:22.333
- You should meet
my other friends.
- 你应该见面
我的其他朋友。

05:22.400 --> 05:24.100
They are gonna love you.
他们会爱你的。

05:24.167 --> 05:26.233
- I already love them!
- 我已经爱他们了！

05:26.300 --> 05:29.300
- Meow...
- 喵...

05:31.067 --> 05:33.333
- Oh--ooh, there's my buddy,
Squidward!
- 哦-哦，这是我的朋友，
章鱼哥！

05:33.400 --> 05:35.967
- You're gonna love him.
- 你会爱他的。

05:36.067 --> 05:39.867
He's funny and nice
and very polite.
他很有趣又友善
而且非常有礼貌。

05:39.933 --> 05:41.600
Hey, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

05:41.667 --> 05:43.500
Hi!
你好！

05:43.567 --> 05:46.067
I said hey, Squidward!
我说嘿，章鱼哥！

05:46.100 --> 05:49.367
- Please get out of my way,
and stop talking to me.
- 请别挡我的路
别跟我说话了。

05:49.433 --> 05:50.667
- See, Cuddle E.,
he said please.
- 看，卡德尔·E.，
他说请。

05:50.733 --> 05:52.067
I told you he was polite.
我告诉过你他很有礼貌。

05:53.733 --> 05:55.767
- My new best friend.
Wanted you to meet him.
- 我最好的新朋友。
想让你见见他。

05:55.833 --> 05:58.367
I don't have time
for your stupid games.
我没有时间
为了你愚蠢的游戏。

05:58.433 --> 06:00.367
Now move it!
- Ah!
现在就动起来吧！
- 啊！

06:02.500 --> 06:04.433
Sorry about that.
对此感到抱歉。

06:04.500 --> 06:06.567
I--I don't know
what's gotten into him today.
我——我不知道
他今天怎么了。

06:06.633 --> 06:09.133
- No need to be sorry,
SpongeBob.
- 无需抱歉，
海绵宝宝。

06:09.200 --> 06:12.167
I'm your best friend!
我是你最好的朋友！

06:14.067 --> 06:17.633
- Aw, your furry tummy
feels like home.
- 噢，你毛茸茸的肚子
感觉就像在家一样。

06:17.700 --> 06:20.833
- Hey, SpongeBob,
why are you hugging the air?
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，
你为什么拥抱空气？

06:20.900 --> 06:22.733
- Hey, Patrick,
I'm not hugging the air.
- 嘿，帕特里克，
我没有拥抱空气。

06:22.800 --> 06:24.733
I'm hugging Cuddle E. Hugs.
我正在拥抱 Cuddle E. Hugs。

06:24.800 --> 06:26.467
- Uh, mm...
- 呃，嗯……

06:26.533 --> 06:29.267
Are you playing
some kind of trick on me?
你在玩吗
对我有什么诡计吗？

06:29.333 --> 06:30.933
There's no one there.
那里没有人。

06:31.067 --> 06:33.600
- Course there's someone here.
He's my new best friend.
- 当然有人在这里。
他是我最好的新朋友。

06:33.667 --> 06:36.267
But I'm your best friend.
但我是你最好的朋友。

06:36.333 --> 06:39.133
- Oh, yes, you are,
but so is Cuddle E. Hugs,
- 哦，是的，你是，
但 Cuddle E. Hugs 也是如此，

06:39.200 --> 06:43.233
and I have enough love
in my heart for both of you.
我有足够的爱
在我心里为你们俩。

06:43.300 --> 06:45.367
No!
不！

06:45.433 --> 06:47.067
I want all your love!
我想要你全部的爱！

06:47.100 --> 06:48.567
Give me it!
给我吧！

06:50.100 --> 06:52.333
SpongeBob's my best friend!
海绵宝宝是我最好的朋友！

06:52.400 --> 06:55.067
Mine!
矿！

06:55.133 --> 06:57.167
Give me his love!
给我他的爱吧！

06:58.900 --> 07:02.800
No! No, no!
不！不，不！

07:04.467 --> 07:05.733
He looks madder
than a rattlesnake
他看上去更生气了
比响尾蛇

07:05.800 --> 07:07.467
in a room full of
rocking chairs.
在一个充满了
摇椅。

07:07.533 --> 07:09.667
- I just tried to introduce him
to my friend, Cuddle E. Hugs,
- 我只是想介绍他
致我的朋友 Cuddle E. Hugs，

07:09.733 --> 07:11.533
and he went crazy!
他疯了！

07:11.600 --> 07:13.133
In fact,
everyone's acting weird.
事实上，
每个人都表现得很奇怪。

07:13.200 --> 07:15.100
They're all pretending
they can't see him.
他们都在假装
他们看不到他。

07:15.167 --> 07:17.400
- Well, where is
this new friend of yours?
- 那么，在哪里
你的这位新朋友？

07:17.467 --> 07:19.067
- Oh, not you too, Sandy!
- 哦，你也不是，桑迪！

07:19.100 --> 07:22.333
He's standing right there!
他就站在那里！

07:22.400 --> 07:25.067
Well, I'm sorry, SpongeBob,
but I don't see anyone.
好吧，对不起，海绵宝宝，
但我没有看到任何人。

07:25.067 --> 07:28.967
- He's the giant hamster,
right there!
- 他是巨型仓鼠
就在那里！

07:29.067 --> 07:30.533
- Oh, I get it.
- 哦，我明白了。

07:30.600 --> 07:33.533
He's your imaginary friend.
他是你想象中的朋友。

07:33.600 --> 07:36.600
- But he's not imaginary.
He's real!
- 但他不是想象出来的。
他是真实的！

07:36.667 --> 07:38.733
- Oh, no need to get
so fiery, SpongeBob.
-哦，没必要得到
如此火热，海绵宝宝。

07:38.800 --> 07:41.067
It's okay to have
an imaginary friend.
拥有就好了
一个想象中的朋友。

07:41.067 --> 07:42.233
Lots of people do.
很多人都这样做。

07:42.300 --> 07:44.533
You two have fun now, ya hear?
你们两个现在玩得很开心，听到了吗？

07:46.700 --> 07:48.867
I was so excited
to introduce you to my friends,
我很兴奋
把你介绍给我的朋友们，

07:48.933 --> 07:50.900
but now they're all
acting strange.
但现在他们都
表现得很奇怪。

07:50.967 --> 07:54.933
- I hate to see ya
so upset, SpongeBob.
- 我讨厌见到你
海绵宝宝，好难过啊

07:55.067 --> 07:56.200
But take heart.
但请放心。

07:56.267 --> 07:57.800
There's a reason
your friends can't see me.
这是有原因的
你的朋友看不到我。

07:57.867 --> 07:59.767
- Of course!
- 当然！

07:59.833 --> 08:03.667
Unlike you, they never ate
the magic sandwich.
与你不同，他们从不吃东西
神奇的三明治。

08:03.733 --> 08:05.800
What magic sandwich?
什么神奇三明治？

08:05.867 --> 08:08.700
- Why, the one that's
as fuzzy as me, of course.
- 为什么，就是那个
当然，和我一样模糊。

08:08.767 --> 08:11.700
- You mean the moldy
Krabby Patty I found at work?
- 你是说发霉的
我在工作中发现的蟹黄派蒂？

08:11.767 --> 08:13.667
- You say moldy Krabby Patty,
- 你说发霉的克拉比帕蒂，

08:13.733 --> 08:16.400
I say magic sandwich.
我说魔法三明治。

08:16.467 --> 08:18.067
- Hmm...
- 唔...

08:18.100 --> 08:20.100
Maybe I should share my magic
sandwich with my friends.
也许我应该分享我的魔法
和我的朋友们一起吃三明治。

08:20.167 --> 08:23.267
That way, they can see you,
and see how awesome you are!
这样他们就能看到你
看看你有多棒！

08:23.333 --> 08:26.900
- Yes! Let them witness
my fuzzy tummy.
- 是的！让他们见证
我毛茸茸的肚子。

08:26.967 --> 08:28.667
Tummy...
肚子...

08:28.733 --> 08:31.167
- Tummy, tummy,
tummy, tummy, tummy.
- 肚子，肚子，
肚子，肚子，肚子。

08:34.433 --> 08:36.133
There! Enough for everyone.
那里！对每个人来说都足够了。

08:36.200 --> 08:39.400
- Excellent, SpongeBob.
- 太棒了，海绵宝宝。

08:43.800 --> 08:46.267
Okay, let's go.
好吧，我们走吧。

08:49.967 --> 08:52.567
Aged Krabby Patties here!
老蟹肉饼来啦！

08:52.633 --> 08:57.167
Get your artisanal aged
Krabby Patties here!
让您的手工艺品老化
蟹肉饼来啦！

08:57.233 --> 09:00.167
Did I mention they were free?
我有没有提到它们是免费的？

09:11.867 --> 09:15.667
Do you see Cuddle E. Hugs?
你看到拥抱 E. 拥抱了吗？

09:15.733 --> 09:19.533
Yes!
是的！

09:19.600 --> 09:22.133
Oh, he's glorious!
哦，他是荣耀的！

09:22.200 --> 09:25.533
- Yeah, his fur looks silkier
than actual silk.
- 是的，他的皮毛看起来更丝滑
比真正的丝绸。

09:25.600 --> 09:29.067
- Yes, make them
all see me, SpongeBob!
- 是的，制作它们
大家都来看我吧，海绵宝宝！

09:29.100 --> 09:32.767
Make them all see,
Cuddle E. Hugs.
让他们都看到，
拥抱E。拥抱。

09:32.833 --> 09:36.500
- SpongeBob, what are you doing
giving away free food?
- 海绵宝宝，你在做什么
赠送免费食物？

09:36.567 --> 09:38.333
Are you cra--
你是不是——

09:48.333 --> 09:51.467
I can't resist the fuzzy.
我无法抗拒模糊。

09:51.533 --> 09:53.867
Come, everyone,
来吧，大家，

09:53.933 --> 09:55.667
and hug your new best friend!
拥抱你最好的新朋友！

10:07.267 --> 10:09.067
- No, Cuddle E. Hugs, no!
- 不，拥抱E。拥抱，不！

10:09.133 --> 10:13.500
- Yes, SpongeBob
SquarePants, yes!
- 是的，海绵宝宝
方裤，是的！

10:15.533 --> 10:17.567
- Sorry, I'm late, I...
- 对不起，我迟到了，我...

10:21.167 --> 10:23.867
Um... back to bed.
嗯……回到床上去。

10:28.933 --> 10:31.700
I thought we were friends!
我以为我们是朋友！

10:35.867 --> 10:37.767
What happened?
发生了什么？

10:37.833 --> 10:39.800
Oh...
哦...

10:39.867 --> 10:43.000
Well, your friend ate me
is what happened.
好吧，你的朋友吃了我
发生了什么事。

10:43.067 --> 10:44.467
Not cool!
不酷！

10:46.100 --> 10:47.767
Yeah, grumble!
是啊，发牢骚！

10:47.833 --> 10:49.800
- Sorry, everyone.
- 对不起，大家。

10:53.733 --> 10:55.367
- You need to
imagine your friends
- 你需要
想象你的朋友

10:55.433 --> 10:58.267
more carefully, SpongeBob.
更仔细一点，海绵宝宝。

11:00.900 --> 11:02.533
- I just don't get it.
- 我就是不明白。

11:02.600 --> 11:04.533
Why did he act like that
last night?
他为什么这么做
昨晚？

11:04.600 --> 11:06.767
I thought we were BFFs.
我以为我们是好朋友。

11:06.833 --> 11:09.233
I need to talk to him.
我需要和他谈谈。

11:15.333 --> 11:18.800
- Crazy time last night,
right, bro?
- 昨晚的疯狂时光，
对吧，兄弟？

11:18.867 --> 11:21.067
- Don't "bro" me,
Cuddle E. Hugs.
- 别跟我说“兄弟”
拥抱E。拥抱。

11:21.100 --> 11:23.867
You embarrassed me last night,
and you ate all my friends!
昨晚你让我尴尬了
你还吃了我所有的朋友！

11:23.933 --> 11:25.500
Why would you do that?
你为什么要这么做？

11:25.567 --> 11:26.900
- Didn't you ever wonder
- 你有没有想过

11:26.967 --> 11:29.433
what the E in my name
stands for?
我名字中的E是什么
代表？

11:29.500 --> 11:30.600
It's Eat!
是吃！

11:30.667 --> 11:32.567
I'm always hungry, ya know?
我总是很饿，你知道吗？

11:32.633 --> 11:34.767
- Oh!
Well, why didn't you say so?
- 哦！
嗯，你为什么不这么说呢？

11:34.833 --> 11:37.333
Here, have the last
of my Patty.
在这里，还有最后的
我的帕蒂。

11:39.500 --> 11:42.567
Wait, no! No!
等等，不！不！

11:44.433 --> 11:46.200
What?
什么？

11:46.267 --> 11:48.433
Oh, pellets.
哦，颗粒。

哦，颗粒。